<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>quote bars drawn by one gradient paint each colour at its length</title>
<meta name="assert" content="Mail compose draws one bar per quote level with hard stops (scripts/ideas/AZMAIL_EXPLORATION_2026_09_30.md 5.3)."/>
</head>
<body><div style="width:100px;height:40px;background:linear-gradient(to right, blue 0, blue 3px, white 3px, white 6px, green 6px, green 9px, white 9px)"></div>
</body>
